B) Create a one-page printable status memo you can bring to the status conference?
C) Anything else specific (e.g., a tailored list of documents based on whether there are children or business assets)?

Tell me which option (A, B, or C) you want or give me any additional details (children, largest assets, temporary orders) and I’ll prepare it.

