- What is our bottom-line (reservation value) and target for settlement? What’s your suggested negotiation posture?
- Should we propose mediation or binding arbitration? When would you recommend trying mediation?
- If the other side offers X, would you recommend accepting? (Ask him to give specific example settlement numbers or ranges.)

Procedural / legal mechanics
- What will the status conference judge typically expect us to present in two months? (e.g., proposed schedule, discovery plan, settlement status)
- What pretrial motions are likely (custody evaluation, discovery disputes, temporary relief)?
