Attorney performance / fees
- What is the fee structure and retainer for trial preparation and trial? When will I be billed for experts or other costs?
- If settlement is reached, will you handle drafting and finalizing the settlement agreement? Is that included or extra?

3) What the court will likely want at the status conference
- A proposed scheduling order (deadlines for discovery, motions, and trial date estimates).
- Confirmation whether parties have attempted or plan to attempt ADR (mediation/negotiation).
- Brief status of discovery and any outstanding disputes.
- Estimated length of trial and readiness to proceed.
