- “What discovery or expert reports do we need before we can reasonably evaluate a settlement?”
- “What is your recommendation: mediate now, negotiate more, or prepare for trial? Why?”
- “If I accept a settlement, what specific protections will you include to make it enforceable and durable?”
- “What will this cost me to go to trial, and how long will it take to resolve?”

