Next steps I can help with
- Tailor the list of questions specifically to your situation (property types, children, business ownership, prenup, etc.)
- Draft or send the email to Robert Kim requesting a meeting or create a checklist you can print
- Create a one‑page agenda you can bring to your meeting so you cover everything efficiently

